Chromium 159.0.8154.18 -> 159.0.8154.27, for the 159.0.8154.18 tarball.

159.0.8154.27 is a tag on the 159 branch (refs/branch-heads/8154@{#953}) that
has no source tarball (as of 2026-11-18). It adds 82 branch commits to
159.0.8154.18 (#871), the newest tag with a tarball, among them PGO/orderfile
rolls, translation updates and VERSION increments. It adds, among many CHECKs
turned back into DCHECKs and Omnibox (the location bar's dropdown on the
Unbounded Element API), Contextual Tasks and aim-drive changes: WebCodecs'
callbacks routed to the execution context's task runners, SyncLoadContext's
completion deferred while handling redirects, ServiceWorker's fetch response
callbacks invoked directly from Take() and its startup queued during network
restriction registration, File System Access' platform path resolution
disallowed in incognito, OTP's PSL matching in non-login flows behind a flag; in
the dependency rolls: ANGLE's translator validating gl_PerVertex member types.

Generated from the upstream diffs between the tags: chromium/src
refs/tags/159.0.8154.18..refs/tags/159.0.8154.27 and the dependencies whose
DEPS revision changed (ANGLE 0f0b90f0b5bf..525fbae78ff2, Dawn
69bfa246b5d7..e8069b445d6e: no file of Dawn's is kept, only the stamps below
change), as served by Gitiles, with scripts/chromium-delta. The other
dependencies' DEPS revisions don't change (the .18 tarball has them).

Left out, as they cannot affect a Linux build: files not in the release
tarball, iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only files, tests and docs,
translations (but en-GB), CI configuration, PGO/orderfile pointers, submodule
pointer updates, DEPS. GN files (*.gn, *.gni) are kept even for tests and other
platforms: gn gen reads test targets' BUILD.gn too.

Added: the tarball's stamp files for the new commit (stamps.py:
build/util/LASTCHANGE{,.committime}, gpu/config/gpu_lists_version.h,
gpu/webgpu/DAWN_VERSION and gpu/webgpu/dawn_commit_hash.h; commit
da5159d1f39fb6b3b0735b968df4aae0902e148e, refs/branch-heads/8154@{#953}).
skia/ext/skia_commit_hash.h (Skia's DEPS revision doesn't change) and
build/util/MINIBRANCH don't change.

Checked: applies to the 159.0.8154.18 tarball; chrome/VERSION becomes
159.0.8154.27; every patched source file is byte-identical to its version
at the tag (or its dependency's DEPS revision); it adds 2 files and deletes
none; the 159.0.8154.18 tarball's non-git files are all classified
(tarball-generated.py with generated.conf).

Apply with git apply.

